{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kingfisher-site-hallissey-dark-brown-dealer-boot-2511-0153","content_id":"9cd5e7e2-9462-4529-bf22-49f1edc6d623","description":"Product Recall for Site Hallissey Dark Brown Dealer Boot presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a748045c-e17b-4de9-9e60-fb9646a4d363","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-24T13:02:26+00:00","id":"a748045c-e17b-4de9-9e60-fb9646a4d363","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-24T13:02:26+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694be4625f0c20ad0a9d30f7/2511-0153-product-recall-kingfisher-dealerboot.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Site Hallissey Dark Brown Dealer Boot</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: It has been identified that the specified batches of Site Hallissey Dealer Boots have defective anti-static protection.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) – Safety/Protective/Occupational Boots</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Site</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Dark brown safety boots available in sizes 7-12.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a748045c-e17b-4de9-9e60-fb9646a4d363\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694be4625f0c20ad0a9d30f7/2511-0153-product-recall-kingfisher-dealerboot.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"affected-products\">Affected products</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product code</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Batch Codes Impacted</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>921XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 7</td>\n      <td>5059340598260</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 09/2022</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>965XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 8</td>\n      <td>5059340602295</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 10/2022</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>492XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 9</td>\n      <td>5059340600635</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 11/2022</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>719XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 10</td>\n      <td>5059340598314</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 12/2022</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>132XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 11</td>\n      <td>5059340599946</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 01/2023</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>713XR</td>\n      <td>Site Hallissey Dealer Boot Dark Brown Uk 12</td>\n      <td>5059340603933</td>\n      <td>DOM on or after 02/2023</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>It has been identified that the specified batches of Site Hallissey Dealer Boots have defective anti-static protection. This could lead to a build-up of static electricity, which if used in an anti-static or static-sensitive environment may result in static discharge, injuring the user.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 2016/425 on Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.\nOwners are advised to stop using the product immediately.</p>\n\n<p>For Screwfix purchases: For further information and for assistance with Screwfix customer queries, please contact 03330 112 112 or email <a href=\"mailto:recall@screwfix.com\">recall@screwfix.com</a>. The Screwfix recall page can be accessed at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.screwfix.com%2Fhelp%2Fproduct-recall&amp;data=05%7C02%7Copssincidentmanagement%40businessandtrade.gov.uk%7C52d5e01018124a5f4ff908de42e97ab3%7C8fa217ec33aa46fbad96dfe68006bb86%7C0%7C0%7C639021767800114905%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=fAE%2BKhVXdqeQDWSiqYcZhtZkV6C7%2BJp2DN4v2G7HYEo%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Product Safety Notices &amp; Recalls - Help - Screwfix</a></p>\n\n<p>For B&amp;Q purchases: For further information and for assistance with B&amp;Q customer queries, please contact 0300 303 4482  and further details can be accessed via the B&amp;Q recall page at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.diy.com%2Fproduct-information%2Fproduct-recall&amp;data=05%7C02%7Copssincidentmanagement%40businessandtrade.gov.uk%7C52d5e01018124a5f4ff908de42e97ab3%7C8fa217ec33aa46fbad96dfe68006bb86%7C0%7C0%7C639021767800128819%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=U91gHkqKMxnV%2Fyuw1sEuVnmCTKdgnooplnrdCSzwtZc%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Product recalls and safety notices at B&amp;Q</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0153</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T10:03:58Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"affected-products","level":2,"text":"Affected products"},{"id":"hazard","